<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia sugar imports April 1-30.</title>
<headline>Indonesia sugar imports April 1-30.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imports of sugar arriving at Tanjung Priok Port, Jakarta, and Belawan Port in North Sumatra in March 1997, based on data made available to Reuters by the ports.</p>
<p>TANJUNG PRIOK</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHIP	     DATE/ARRIVAL	  CARGO/TONNES     FROM</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Great Best	 02-04-97	    sugar		Thailand</p>
<p>					     13,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Progress-	  05-04-97	    sugar		Thailand</p>
<p>Excellence				 13,200 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Great Concert    11-04-97	    sugar		Kosichang</p>
<p>					     13,638 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>BELAWAN</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Tongahun	14-04-97	    sugar		Thailand</p>
<p>					     10,700 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Lan Cang-     15-04-97	    sugar		Kosichang</p>
<p>Jiang					12,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>--Jakarta Newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
